A '''Wriggling Larva''' is an {{Epic}} [[Permanent Consumable]] item used to increase the player's {{Stat|Bonus Pest Chance}}.

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
{{Drop Sources}}

== Usage ==
Consuming a '''Wriggling Larva''' grants {{SBXP|+5}} and a permanent {{Stat|bonus pest chance|+2}}. Up to {{Green|5}} '''Wriggling Larva''' can be consumed in total.

